      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "kill",
          "target_kind": "npc",
          "target_id": 250873,
          "count": 8,
          "name": "Juvenile Vuldren slain (8)",
          "source": "objective table"
        }
      ],
      "text": {
        "objectives": "Slay 8 Vuldren Juveniles in Thendal Grove.\n \nJuvenile Vuldren slain (8)",
        "description": "We live in times of great uncertainty for our people. We face unprecedented challenges that may require bold solutions, but we also must contend with the ordinary and mundane here in Thendal Grove. Take, for example, the recent unsustainable rise in the vuldren population.\n\nThe vuldren are a vital part of our ecosystem. However, imbalances must be corrected to maintain the delicate harmony that all creatures in Thendal Grove share.\n\nHead east and cull some of the vuldren there.",
        "completion": "Thank you for your service to Zephras, young <class>.\n\nThe vuldren are typically quite docile, but the animals that call Zephras home can sense when the magic on the winds is out of balance, which can lead to dangerous and unpredictable behavior if left unchecked."
      },
