      "objectives": [],
      "text": {
        "objectives": "Use your Skysight racial ability at the Elemental Convergence in Thendal Grove.\n \nUse Skysight near the Elemental Convergence (1)",
        "description": "As a Windshaper, you have the ability to use the sacred skysight gifted to us by the elemental spirits. Travel to the standing stones to the northeast of the village. Find the elemental convergence there and use your gift.\n\nYou'll find that you may draw upon the skysight anywhere, but its boon is much more powerful if you do so in the presence of an elemental convergence. You may at times receive other bits of wisdom from the spirits that are drawn to such places of power, as well.",
        "completion": "Like a muscle, your skysight must be exercised if you hope to grow stronger in the gift. Leveraging your skysight to bridge the distance between the mortal and the spiritual may prove invaluable to you in your adventures.\n\nYou'd do well to remember what you've learned here today. Our ability to use our gifts to hear what the elements tell us could be the key to our survival."
      },
